  "notable_quotes": [
    "Adding SIFSIX-3-Ni, an ultraselective CO2 sorbent, should remove trace CO2 from four-component feeds and extend the process to one-step quaternary separation.",
    "SIFSIX-3-Ni is CO2-selective at low pressure: below 0.2 bar and 298 K, CO2 has the highest uptake among the gases tested.",
    "At 298 K and 1 bar, TIFSIX-2-Cu-i adsorbs less C2H6 (2.1 mmol/g) than C2H4 (2.6), CO2 (4.3), and C2H2 (4.1), confirming it is not C2H6-selective."
  ],
